      "message": "As on 113.sld:1323: registering makes 128\u0027s `default-hash` switch to `%slow-hash` for the whole program. Tables built with the default comparator before this library loads lose their keys, and default hashing gets slower. The spec no longer requires registering (post-finalization note).",
      "revId": "3238d22f6af70e356c32dad7fc3ac652b3a7627b",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
