      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T21:24:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: hashmaps can\u0027t be keys of mappings, since the hashmap comparator has no ordering. `(mapping c (hashmap c 1 2) \u0027a (hashmap c 3 4) \u0027b)` raises \"comparator has no ordering\". Reword the comment.",
      "revId": "3238d22f6af70e356c32dad7fc3ac652b3a7627b",
